   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sojiro",
   "en": "Didn't I tell you not to be reckless?",
   "uk": "Хіба я не казав тобі не лізти на рожен?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Man in a Suit",
   "en": "Well then... you're coming with us.",
   "uk": "Отже... ти підеш із нами.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Man in a Suit",
   "en": "I'm sorry, but it has to be now.",
   "uk": "Перепрошую, але це треба зробити зараз.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sojiro",
